 267:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_gpio.c ****   *         GPIOx_PUPDR, GPIOx_AFRL and GPIOx_AFRH.
 268:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_gpio.c ****   * @note   The configuration of the locked GPIO pins can no longer be modified
 269:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_gpio.c ****   *         until the next reset.
